MODULE: RepairAppliedReplayResurrects
TARGET: NewerPeerPreserved
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a retry replays a committed repair over a legitimately newer ordinary peer
PERTURBS: Retry

--- FIND
Retry(v) ==
    /\ Live /\ v \in Fresh
    /\ UNCHANGED vars
--- REPLACE
Retry(v) ==
    /\ Live /\ v \in Fresh /\ repairApplied
    /\ rows' = [rows EXCEPT ![v][target[v]] = captured[v]]
    /\ UNCHANGED <<Coordinator,source,bound,reported,stage,Snapshots,retired,
                   faults,ordinarySeen>>
--- END
